LogFile /Library/Application Support/ERPX-Attachments/log/clamd.log
LogTime yes
LogRotate yes
PidFile /Library/Application Support/ERPX-Attachments/run/clamd.pid
DatabaseDirectory /Library/Application Support/ERPX-Attachments/db
OfficialDatabaseOnly yes
FailIfCvdOlderThan 1
LocalSocket /Library/Application Support/ERPX-Attachments/run/clamd.sock
LocalSocketGroup _erpx_scanner
LocalSocketMode 660
FixStaleSocket yes
StreamMaxLength 11M
MaxScanSize 20M
MaxFileSize 11M
MaxThreads 4
ReadTimeout 30
CommandReadTimeout 5
SendBufTimeout 30
Foreground yes
